        "description": "An extremely fast and condescending shipgirl based on the real-life experimental Japanese destroyer Shimakaze. She's always seen either accompanied by or carrying one to three Rensouhou-chan, her robot mascots based on the 12.7cm twin-mounted gun, and is shown to easily get bored unless she gets to show off her speed.\n\nIn the first anime, she attends the same class as [Fubuki](https://anilist.co/character/88816/Fubuki) and her friends, but is not part of her usual circle.\n\nIn the *Shimakaze Tsumujikaze no Shoujo* manga, she feels depressed about being the only ship of her class, which causes her to antagonize [Asashio](https://anilist.co/character/383182/Asashio), who notoriously hails from a sizeable line of ships.",
