        "description": "A carefree and cheerful shipgirl based on the real-life Japanese destroyer Yuudachi. She has a habit of randomly exclaiming \"っぽい\" (\"poi\"), as well as integrating it into her sentences (oftentimes at the end).\n\nIn the first anime, she's a member of the Third Torpedo Squadron and part of [Fubuki](https://anilist.co/character/88816/Fubuki)'s main group of friends. In the *Shimakaze Tsumujikaze no Shoujo* manga, she's introduced as a more experienced shipgirl called in to help train [Shimakaze](https://anilist.co/character/88113/Shimakaze) and [Asashio](https://anilist.co/character/383182/Asashio).",
