        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b154018-wm6HO9jDdkdm.jpg"
        },
        "description": "A shipgirl stationed at the Truk Lagoon forward base during Operation FS, said to be the most powerful battleship ever built. She's also a great chef, serving luxurious home-cooked meals to [Fubuki](https://anilist.co/character/88816/Fubuki) and friends upon their meeting. However, she rarely sees any real action - much to Fubuki's disappointment - as her firepower is deemed excessive and she's said to use up too many resources (including food, as she also possesses a tremendous appetite, comparable to Akagi's) for Admiral to consider deploying her more frequently. As a result, her existence is largely kept secret.\n\nHer namesake is the Japanese battleship [Yamato](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_battleship_Yamato) and her sister ship is Musashi.",
