        "description": "A calm and no-nonsense bow-wielding shipgirl based on the real-life Japanese aircraft carrier Kaga. Sister ship to [Akagi](https://anilist.co/character/174622/Akagi).\n\nIn the *Shimakaze Tsumujikaze no Shoujo* manga, she's given a considerably darker characterization than in the first anime and *Fubuki, Ganbarimasu* 4koma, as she states her siblings \"never got a chance to be born\" and deems her very existence a mistake. However, she ends up bonding with Shimakaze over their mutual feelings.\n",
